  "description": "The Tempt E+ is fully outfitted with 100 mm of front suspension, hydraulic disc brakes, and plenty of power assist to get you up those hills with a smile on your face. Designed to match you with just the right wheel size for balance and maneuverability, XS and S frames come with 27.5-inch wheels, while M and L frames come with 29-inch wheels. The handlebar-mounted RideControl ONE lets you adjust riding modes, and it has key data indicators – battery level and support level. The Tempt E+ gives you the power to choose from five levels of assistance, so you can control your speed, how hard you want to pedal, and extend the battery life. Built specifically for women in both frame geometry and contact points, along with an integrated battery and motor design, the Tempt E+ provides a speedy power-assisted ride.",
